CDialogTree
{
Name=The Caverns
Portrait=!None
Should Have Voiceovers=0
Default Canceled Node Action=
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=1 nothing answers
Text=The Hujark strikes the floor with the flat of his blade and calls, the way the others have been calling all along this corridor. Nothing comes up out of it. He looks at the ring on your hand, and he does not understand what he is looking at, and he goes back to fighting.
Should Have Voiceover=0
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=2 the snake den
Text=The passage narrows and keeps narrowing. Snakebreed have nested in the cracks of it, and the Hujark have left their own dead where they fell rather than come this far in to fetch them.
Should Have Voiceover=0
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=3 what the den keeps
Text=The crack ends. Whatever the Hujark wanted out of this cave they stopped wanting some time ago, and what they left is still lying in it.
Should Have Voiceover=0
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=4 the store cave
Text=A store cave, or it was. The shelves cut into the rock have been swept clean, the sweepings are underfoot, and something has been breeding in the dark at the back of it.
Should Have Voiceover=0
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=5 what nobody came back for
Text=Somebody hid this and did not come back for it. The dust on it is the same dust as on everything else, which means nobody has looked here in a very long time.
Should Have Voiceover=0
}
